# Optional. Copy to worker/windows_python.path (one line, no comments in the actual file).
# Prefer omitting this file in release — RhythmFallServer.exe looks for:
#   <game>\RhythmFallServer\.venv\Scripts\python.exe
#
# Relative to game root (recommended if you need a hint file):
# RhythmFallServer\.venv\Scripts\python.exe
#
# Absolute only for non-standard layouts:
# C:\Users\YOU\AppData\Local\Programs\Python\Python311\python.exe
